71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7XmbpLnsovsQ7kNvwF3q_ca&_nc_oc=AdqZLcGu2pjBR3krQEQdzzQrifzz5qqsiatH5mTukBiFNAQCyxVWey3tp39Pf27-THM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_kAfaVWy2K3B9O9AfdCEveCAKNesP5HV1RR9GUHIFnWg&oe=6A3E7A39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LxZzoHGIAUsQ7kNvwEAPqSS&_nc_oc=AdoGBDg_2Tn-ngCTI54xy4BxNarRzrwcV8oOBtDAInWM5G658xjUiw4__wUkxpaC5AE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_zNAk1GzVvX5jKgcI-O7T5NG_mDpBUGFFaBs9L3JiZBA&oe=6A3E8D13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fViAdLB3aIcQ7kNvwGQGynY&_nc_oc=AdoI2jqmsjKPcKctIOByhPrdIS1yMOesTc2O58P5AXj8PpLlr-d2vmUo4y3Q7A0YkJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9i7yRapkMvjcbfmdxRiNMg6cbzugE2B-NMcW_2sHXehA&oe=6A3E8B5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: